[[2047,96,65536,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The special switch for the steering column\nswitch unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               controls the operation of the rearscreen wash/wipe.</p><p>The stalk unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is supplied at\npin 3 of connector D from the ignition-operated line (INT/A) of\nthe relay  \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               protected by the fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F14</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : both are\ncontained in the junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>When operated, the rearscreen wash/wipe\nswitch for the steering column switch unit H5, sends control signals\nfrom connector D: from pin 1 to the rearscreen wiper motor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N16</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ;\nfrom pin 2 to the rearscreen wiper control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M79</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , pin \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B7</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M79</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               controls system\noperation via the sequence described previously, via a signal from\npin C6 for rear wiper motor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N16</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>When operated, the windscreen washer switch\non the steering column switch unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends two signals from\npin 8 and pin 9 of connector A, the first to windscreen wiper control\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M79</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin B4), the second is directly connected to pump \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N22</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The motor is operated upon a command from\nwinscreen wiper control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M79</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , pin C2, in the opposite\nmanner to that described for the washer function (when the motor\nis operated in reverse, it sends fluid to the back instead of to the\nfront).</p><p>The control unit also receives a signal\n- pin A5 - from reversing sensor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>I20</strong><a href=\"#/3233866\">E2022</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              to\noperate the rear wiper automatically.</p>"]]